				},
				{
					"id": 740831004,
					"content": "無影蹤，珀西芙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831005,
					"content": "好吧…妳真是我見過的最特別的美露莘…對了，我印象中的美露莘，大多都生活在楓丹廷或者海沫村…妳怎麼會在這裡呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831006,
					"content": "楓丹廷？海沫村？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831007,
					"content": "看妳好像很疑惑的樣子，妳沒聽過這兩個名字嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831008,
					"content": "楓丹廷、美露莘…海沫村、美露莘…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831009,
					"content": "啊…伊黎耶、珀西芙、家鄉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831010,
					"content": "伊黎耶、珀西芙，守護！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831011,
					"content": "等等！妳說這裡是妳的家鄉？妳在守護妳的家鄉？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831012,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831013,
					"content": "可是美露莘的家鄉是海沫村吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831014
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740831014,
					"content": "是啊！好奇怪，還有出生在別的地方的美露莘嗎？可是這裡看起來也沒有其他美露莘了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831015,
					"content": "珀西芙，妳都是一個人生活在這裡的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831016
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831016,
					"content": "一個人？美露莘。那位來客！珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831017,
					"content": "那…那位來客？還有一位來客？哪位來客？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831018
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831018,
					"content": "#那位來客！派蒙、派蒙，{NICKNAME}、{NICKNAME}，那位來客、那位來客！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
