					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831019,
					"content": "所以那位來客是誰？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831020
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740831020,
					"content": "珀西芙…妳不會是想說，就像派蒙叫派蒙一樣，那位來客就叫那位來客？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831021
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831021,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831022
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831022,
					"content": "啊哈！果然是這樣，我就說，我也是很聰明的嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831023,
						740831024
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831023,
					"content": "這名字太怪了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831025
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740831025,
					"content": "那位來客，珀西芙，知識，邦邦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831026
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831026,
					"content": "嗯…妳是說那位來客幫妳學會知識？",
