					"nextDialogs": [
						740831032
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831032,
					"content": "是妳幫他守護這裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831033
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740831033,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831034
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831034,
					"content": "居然是這樣…那位來客究竟是什麼人？他為什麼需要妳幫他守護這裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831035
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831035,
					"content": "而且這裡的確發生了一些不好的事，我們看到的石碑，上面的字都被人毀掉了，也出現了不少汙穢…有敵人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831036
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831036,
					"content": "好奇派蒙，珀西芙！但是時間，十分很不多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831037
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831037,
					"content": "鑰匙，鑰匙，鑰匙，廣場，西。邦邦，邦邦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831038
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831038,
					"content": "我們會盡快！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831039
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740831039,
					"content": "#派蒙，珀西芙！{NICKNAME}，珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831040
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740831040,
					"content": "珀西芙高興地蹦跳了兩下，然後略顯匆忙地離開了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740831041
